      "places": [
        "lib/Db/QuotaUserMapper.php:15 OCA\\OpenAi\\Db\\EntityType, by its path OCA\\OpenAi\\Db\\QuotaUserMapper"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 class in lib/ whose name does not follow PSR-4 below OCA\\OpenAi, the namespace the server derives from <namespace> of info.xml. The loader of the server does not find such a class.",
